      "writtenOn": "2022-08-26T13:51:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for the clarification! \n\nThese are my thoughts: \n- If we\u0027re in force source, we probably shouldn\u0027t be allowing the swap to sink.  If you know of any reason you want to support swapping to sink for your use-case, then\n- When exiting from Attached.SNK, we should check FORCE_SOURCE and know that we need to be Unattached.SRC",
      "parentUuid": "c7a571d2_80076bd9",
      "revId": "5d7902cbfecad2254b23a7ca4f12c91dadf18c5f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
