      "writtenOn": "2022-08-26T14:30:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually , your suggestion to chnge state to unattached.src directly, while exiting from attched.SNK also makes sense, which can let us jump to unattched.src 1 step earlier. But i dint see any such reference in pd spec , but noticed the reference of  a condition jump to unattached.src from unattached.sink\u0027s reference in session 4.5.2.2.3.2 ( exiting from unattached.sink). So , i was thinking ,unttached.snk is the right place to chnge to unattched src . Also am wondering, if we place the condition to switch to unattched.src directly from attched.sink, wouldn\u0027t it be violating from spec? Anywz, let me know your thoughts.",
